{"text":"purananuru","n":252,"lines":["கறங்குவெள் அருவி ஏற்றலின் நிறம் பெயர்ந்து","தில்லை அன்ன புல்லென் சடையோடு","அள்இலைத் தாளி கொய்யு மோனே","இல்வழங்கு மடமயில் பிணிக்கும்","சொல்வலை வேட்டுவன் ஆயினன் முன்னே"],"tr":["kaṟaṅkuveḷ aruvi ēṟṟaliṉ niṟam peyarntu","tillai aṉṉa pulleṉ caṭaiyōṭu","aḷilait tāḷi koyyu mōṉē","ilvaḻaṅku maṭamayil piṇikkum","colvalai vēṭṭuvaṉ āyiṉaṉ muṉṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"vākai","tinai_ta":"வாகை","turai_ta":"தாபத வாகை","poet_ta":"மாற்பித்தியார்","poet_tr":"Māṟpittiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"5×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 20"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 13, veṇṭaḷai 6"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கறங்குவெ","tr":"kaṟaṅkuve","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கறங்","tr":"kaṟaṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவெ","tr":"kuve"}]},{"text":"ளருவியேற்","tr":"ḷaruviyēṟ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளரு","tr":"ḷaru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வியேற்","tr":"viyēṟ"}]},{"text":"றலின்நிறம்","tr":"ṟaliṉniṟam","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றலின்","tr":"ṟaliṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நிறம்","tr":"niṟam"}]},{"text":"பெயர்ந்து","tr":"peyarntu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெயர்ந்","tr":"peyarn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"தில்லை","tr":"tillai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தில்","tr":"til"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"யன்ன","tr":"yaṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யன்","tr":"yaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"புல்லென்","tr":"pulleṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புல்","tr":"pul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லென்","tr":"leṉ"}]},{"text":"சடையோ","tr":"caṭaiyō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சடை","tr":"caṭai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோ","tr":"yō"}]}],[{"text":"டள்ளிலைத்","tr":"ṭaḷḷilait","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"டள்","tr":"ṭaḷ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளிலைத்","tr":"ḷilait"}]},{"text":"தாளி","tr":"tāḷi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளி","tr":"ḷi"}]},{"text":"கொய்யு","tr":"koyyu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொய்","tr":"koy"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யு","tr":"yu"}]},{"text":"மோனே","tr":"mōṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மோ","tr":"mō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}],[{"text":"யில்வ","tr":"yilva","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யில்","tr":"yil"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வ","tr":"va"}]},{"text":"ழங்கு","tr":"ḻaṅku","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழங்","tr":"ḻaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]},{"text":"மடமயில்","tr":"maṭamayil","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மட","tr":"maṭa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மயில்","tr":"mayil"}]},{"text":"பிணிக்கும்","tr":"piṇikkum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிணிக்","tr":"piṇik"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]}],[{"text":"சொல்வலை","tr":"colvalai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சொல்","tr":"col"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வலை","tr":"valai"}]},{"text":"வேட்டுவ","tr":"vēṭṭuva","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேட்","tr":"vēṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுவ","tr":"ṭuva"}]},{"text":"னாயினன்","tr":"ṉāyiṉaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினன்","tr":"yiṉaṉ"}]},{"text":"முன்னே","tr":"muṉṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முன்","tr":"muṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கறங்கு","parts":[{"text":"கறங்கு","lemma":"கறங்கு","gloss":"roar"}],"gloss":"roaring"},{"surface":"வெள்","parts":[{"text":"வெள்","lemma":"வெள்","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white"},{"surface":"அருவி","parts":[{"text":"அருவி","lemma":"அருவி","gloss":"waterfall"}],"gloss":"waterfall"},{"surface":"ஏற்றலின்","parts":[{"text":"ஏற்றல்","lemma":"ஏற்றல்","gloss":"bearing"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"because of"}],"gloss":"because of bearing"},{"surface":"நிறம்","parts":[{"text":"நிறம்","lemma":"நிறம்","gloss":"color"}],"gloss":"color"},{"surface":"பெயர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்ந்து","lemma":"பெயர்ந்து","gloss":"having changed"}],"gloss":"having changed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தில்லை","parts":[{"text":"தில்லை","lemma":"தில்லை","gloss":"tillai tree"}],"gloss":"tillai tree"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"புல்லென்","parts":[{"text":"புல்","lemma":"புல்","gloss":"pale"},{"text":"என்","lemma":"எனல்","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"lusterless"},{"surface":"சடையோடு","parts":[{"text":"சடை","lemma":"சடை","gloss":"matted hair"},{"text":"ஓடு","lemma":"ஓடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with matted hair"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அள்","parts":[{"text":"அள்","lemma":"அள்","gloss":"dense"}],"gloss":"dense"},{"surface":"இலை","parts":[{"text":"இலை","lemma":"இலை","gloss":"leaf"}],"gloss":"leaf"},{"surface":"தாளி","parts":[{"text":"தாளி","lemma":"தாளி","gloss":"tāḷi plant"}],"gloss":"tāḷi plant"},{"surface":"கொய்யுமோனே","parts":[{"text":"கொய்","lemma":"கொய்தல்","gloss":"pluck"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival suffix"},{"text":"ஓன்","lemma":"ஓன்","gloss":"he"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"he who plucks indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இல்","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"house"}],"gloss":"house"},{"surface":"வழங்கு","parts":[{"text":"வழங்கு","lemma":"வழங்குதல்","gloss":"moving about"}],"gloss":"moving about"},{"surface":"மட","parts":[{"text":"மட","lemma":"மட","gloss":"gentle"}],"gloss":"gentle","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மயில்","parts":[{"text":"மயில்","lemma":"மயில்","gloss":"peacock"}],"gloss":"peacock"},{"surface":"பிணிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"பிணிக்கும்","lemma":"பிணிக்கும்","gloss":"binding"}],"gloss":"binding","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சொல்","parts":[{"text":"சொல்","lemma":"சொல்","gloss":"word"}],"gloss":"word"},{"surface":"வலை","parts":[{"text":"வலை","lemma":"வலை","gloss":"net"}],"gloss":"net"},{"surface":"வேட்டுவன்","parts":[{"text":"வேட்டுவன்","lemma":"வேட்டுவன்","gloss":"hunter"}],"gloss":"hunter"},{"surface":"ஆயினன்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினன்","lemma":"ஆயினன்","gloss":"he became"}],"gloss":"he became","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"முன்னே","parts":[{"text":"முன்","lemma":"முன்","gloss":"before"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"formerly indeed"}]}],"literal":"Roaring white waterfall because of bearing, color having changed, / Tillai tree like lusterless with matted hair, / dense leaf tāḷi plant he who plucks indeed, / house moving about gentle peacock binding / word net hunter he became formerly indeed.","translation":"Because he stood under the roaring white waterfall, his complexion has changed. With lusterless matted hair resembling the tillai tree, he now plucks the dense-leaved tāḷi herb. Yet, in the past, he was a hunter who cast a net of words to captivate the gentle peacocks who moved about his house.","modern":"ஒலிக்கும் வெண்மையான அருவிநீரைத் தன் மேல் ஏற்றுக்கொண்டதால் தன் உடலின் நிறம் மாறி, தில்லை மரத்தைப் போன்ற பொலிவிழந்த சடைமுடியோடு, அடர்ந்த இலைகளைக் கொண்ட தாளி கீரையைப் பறித்து உண்பவனாக அவன் இப்போது இருக்கிறான். ஆனால், முன்னொரு காலத்தில் அவன் தன் இல்லத்தில் உலவும் இளமையான மயில் போன்ற பெண்களைத் தன் இன்சொல் என்னும் வலையால் கட்டிப்போடும் வேட்டுவனாக இருந்தான்.","explanation":"In this poem, the poet Māṟpittiyār observes a man who has renounced his domestic life to become an ascetic. The poet contrasts the man's present state of severe penance with his luxurious and romantic past. Now, his skin is bleached from bathing under cold mountain waterfalls, his hair is dry and matted like the branches of a tillai tree, and he gathers wild greens for his simple meals. Formerly, however, he was a charming householder who used sweet words as a net to captivate his gentle, peacock-like wives. This stark contrast beautifully illustrates the theme of 'tāpata vākai', which celebrates the greatness and self-control of an ascetic.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}